      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It's clear you see the strain on your mom, and that's a heavy thing to carry. But those feelings of being a drain are just the exhaustion talking, not reality. You are not a burden; you are a person with needs, and it's okay if those needs aren't being met right now. If you're feeling this much despair, please consider talking to someone who can offer immediate support.",
